  "text_md": "![](<4d1758f565fde0a8c262c6fa35f2749c93bf07cba5a49e6853a48f8f387a017a_images/imageFile2.png>)\n\n(19)\n\nEuropaisches\n\nPatentamt\n\nEuropean\n\nPatent Office\n\nOffice européen\n\ndes brevets\n\n![](<4d1758f565fde0a8c262c6fa35f2749c93bf07cba5a49e6853a48f8f387a017a_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\n(11)\n\nEP 1 499 943 B1\n\n(12)\n\n# EUROPEAN PATENT SPECIFICATION\n\n(45) Date of publication and mention of the grant of the patent: 20.04.2011 Bulletin 2011/16\n\n(21) Application number: 02757648.7\n\nfiling:\n\n(22) Date of\n\n(51) Int Cl.: G06F 1/32 (2006.01)\n\n(86) International application number: PCT/US2002/028537\n\nPCTIUS2002/028537\n\n(87) International publication number: WO 2003/027818 (03.04.2003 Gazette 2003/14)\n\n# (54) A METHOD AND APPARATUS TO PROVIDE A USER PRIORITY MODE\n\nVERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUR BEREITSTELLUNG EINES BENUTZERPRIORITÄTSMODUS\n\nPROCEDE ET DISPOSITIF DONNANT UN MODE DE PRIORITE D’UTILISATEUR\n\nDesignated Contracting States:\n\nES FI FR GB GR IE IT LI LU MC NL PT SE SK TR\n\n(30) Priority:\n\n25.09.2001 US 965283\n\n(43) Date of publication of application: 26.01.2005 Bulletin 2005/04\n\n26.01.2005 Bulletin 2005/04\n\nProprietor: Intel Corporation\n\nSanta Clara, CA 95052 (US)\n\n(72) Inventor: STANLEY, Randy Aptos, CA 95003 (US)\n\nAptos, CA 95003 (US)\n\n(74) Representative: Goddar, Heinz J. Forrester & Boehmert\n\nPettenkoferstrasse 20-22 80336 München (DE)\n\n(56) References cited:  \n\nEP-A0 708 398 US-A6 076 171\n\nUS-A5 396 635\n\nNote: Within nine months of the publication of the mention of the grant of the European patent in the European Patent Bulletin, any person may give notice to the European Patent Office of opposition to that patent, in accordance with the Implementing Regulations. Notice of opposition shall not be deemed to have been filed until the opposition fee has been paid. (Art. 99(1) European Patent Convention).\n\n",
